A rule performing an actual reduction step (e.g., ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/beta-reduction.td")}), as opposed to ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/congruence-rule.td")} which merely propagate evaluation into subterms.
